<figure class="f2-circuit">
  <div class="drawing">
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 380 240"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="f2-circuit-title f2-circuit-desc"
    >
      <title id="f2-circuit-title">Divisor de tensão com carga</title>
      <desc id="f2-circuit-desc">
        Fonte de 12 volts ligada a R1 de 2 quilo-ohms em série com o paralelo de
        R2 e da carga RL, ambas de 4 quilo-ohms. A é o nó de saída e B o
        retorno.
      </desc>
      <g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none">
        <path d="M50 90 V50 H110 M170 50 H310 V90 M50 130 V190 H310 V130 M220 50 V90 M220 130 V190" />
        <circle cx="50" cy="110" r="20" />
        <rect x="110" y="40" width="60" height="20" />
        <rect x="210" y="90" width="20" height="40" />
        <rect x="300" y="90" width="20" height="40" />
      </g>
      <g fill="currentColor" font-size="20">
        <text x="44" y="105">
          +
        </text>
        <text x="44" y="122">
          −
        </text>
        <text x="15" y="157">
          12 V
        </text>
        <text x="104" y="25">
          R₁ 2 kΩ
        </text>
        <text x="160" y="107">
          R₂
        </text>
        <text x="157" y="130">
          4 kΩ
        </text>
        <text x="332" y="107">
          Rₗ
        </text>
        <text x="328" y="130">
          4 kΩ
        </text>
        <text x="228" y="77">
          A
        </text>
        <text x="227" y="218">
          B
        </text>
      </g>
      <g fill="var(--accent)">
        <circle cx="220" cy="50" r="4" />
        <circle cx="220" cy="190" r="4" />
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    A carga altera o divisor: R₂ e Rₗ partilham os nós A e B.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
